description: 
alwaysApply: true
---

Retrofit **client** classes in `lib/data/services/clients/<controller>_client.dart` are stateless: no business logic, only typed HTTP endpoints.

The same `lib/data/services/` tree holds Dio (`http/`), interceptors, and shared Retrofit glue (`clients/callback.dart`, `clients/convertors/`, `_clients.dart`). **Do not** add a parallel `lib/data/clients/` folder—keep all Retrofit API surface definitions under `lib/data/services/clients/`.
